+// visionOS compatibility (D-024)
+//
+// UIScreen does not exist on visionOS -- every call site is a compile error,
+// not a runtime nil. There is no screen: the app owns a resizable window in a
+// scene, and everything UIScreen used to answer comes from that scene instead.
